chantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Drysvayla%27s_Axe.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Drysvayla%27s_Axe.png/420px-Drysvayla%27s_Axe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"602\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Drysvayla%27s_Axe.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A fragment of the great Green Dragon's power made manifest, a sad reminder of a day where reason failed.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817041332\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.159 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3858/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32157/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9978/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n105.29%  145.013     56 Template:IO\n100.00%  137.724      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  137.724      1 -total\n 95.41%  131.402      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 37.94%   52.256      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.92%   50.848      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 34.53%   47.556      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 32.48%   44.727     